<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=1.0,user-scalable=no">
<title>川式五香卤水 · 沧林食品</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;background:#f0e9e2;color:#2c2c2c;padding:24px 16px;line-height:1.7}
.card{max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;background:#faf8f5;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.05)}
.meta{padding:20px 22px 14px;background:#fdf8f0;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8}
.meta .badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B;background:#fef2ee;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:6px}
.meta h1{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:2px}
.meta .sub{font-size:12px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-bottom:10px}
.meta .tags{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.meta .tags span{font-size:10px;padding:2px 10px;background:#f5ede5;border-radius:12px;color:#5a4f44}
.level-banner{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:10px 22px;background:#fef9f2;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8;flex-wrap:wrap}
.level-item{font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0e9e2;color:#5a4f44}
.level-item.high{background:#C0392B;color:#fff}
.section{padding:14px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8}
.s-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-bottom:10px;padding-bottom:4px;border-bottom:2px solid #f0ece6}
.story{font-size:13px;line-height:2;color:#5a4f44}
.story em{color:#C0392B;font-style:normal;font-weight:600}
.cost-box{padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px}
.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;padding:4px 0;color:#3a322a}
.row .v{font-weight:600}
.row.tot{border-top:1px solid #ddd4ca;margin-top:4px;padding-top:8px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B}
.talk{padding:10px 14px;background:#fef9f2;border-radius:10px;margin:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.8}
.alert{font-size:11px;color:#b5aaa0;padding:6px 0 0 0;font-style:italic}
.tip-item{padding:8px 12px;background:#fef9f2;border-left:3px solid #C0392B;border-radius:4px;margin:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.6}
.ing-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;margin-top:6px}
.ing-table th{text-align:left;padding:6px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd4ca;color:#3a322a;font-weight:600;font-size:11px}
.ing-table td{padding:5px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f0ea;color:#5a4f44}
.ing-table .cat{font-weight:600;color:#3a322a;background:#f8f4ef}
.paywall{padding:24px 22px;text-align:center;background:#fdf8f0}
.paywall .price{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#C0392B}
.paywall .desc{font-size:13px;color:#7a7269;margin:8px 0 16px;line-height:1.6}
.paywall .btn{display:inline-block;background:#C0392B;color:#fff;padding:10px 32px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;transition:.2s}
.paywall .btn:hover{background:#a33025}
.paywall .up{font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-top:10px}
.free-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;background:#27ae60;color:#fff;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:4px}
.lock-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;background:#C0392B;color:#fff;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:4px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
<div class="meta">
  <div class="badge">LS-001 · 咔库秘制 · ¥39</div>
  <h1>川式五香卤水</h1>
  <div class="sub">50斤高汤 · 25味香料 · 老卤越卤越香</div>
  <div class="tags"><span>#卤水</span><span>#商用</span><span>#五香</span><span>#老卤</span><span>#川式</span></div>
</div>
<div class="level-banner">
  <span class="level-item high">🔥 卤水系列</span>
  <span class="level-item">50斤高汤一锅</span>
  <span class="level-item">可卤100-150斤食材</span>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 📖 产品说</div>
  <div class="story">
    川式五香卤水，跟酱卤不同——酱卤靠酱上色入味，五香卤水靠香料和糖色，卤出来的食材颜色红亮、五香醇和、不腻不齁。<br><br>
    50斤高汤打底，混合油（鸡油+猪油+色拉油）增香，25味香料装袋熬1小时，静置1天让味道融合。卤制时每斤食材加6-8g盐、10g糖色，小火煮到熟透。<br><br>
    辣椒王和大红袍花椒直接撒在汤里，辣麻味散开不闷。其他香料包起来，方便更换。老汤越卤越香，养得好能用三年。<br><br>
    一锅50斤卤水可卤100-150斤食材，适合卤肉、卤鸡、卤蛋、卤豆制品。
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 📋 香料清单</div>
  <table class="ing-table">
    <tr><th>类别</th><th>香料</th><th style="text-align:right">用量</th></tr>
    <tr><td class="cat" rowspan="4">散放汤中</td><td>辣椒王</td><td style="text-align:right">100g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>大红袍花椒</td><td style="text-align:right">50g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>老姜</td><td style="text-align:right">适量</td></tr>
    <tr><td>大葱</td><td style="text-align:right">适量</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="cat" rowspan="21">香料包</td><td>八角</td><td style="text-align:right">80g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>小茴香</td><td style="text-align:right">60g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>沙姜</td><td style="text-align:right">50g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>烟桂</td><td style="text-align:right">50g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>甜草（甘草）</td><td style="text-align:right">50g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>干姜</td><td style="text-align:right">50g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>白芷</td><td style="text-align:right">50g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>川砂仁</td><td style="text-align:right">40g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>肉豆蔻</td><td style="text-align:right">60g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>香果</td><td style="text-align:right">30g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>红蔻</td><td style="text-align:right">30g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>苹果</td><td style="text-align:right">30g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>排草</td><td style="text-align:right">25g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>草蔻</td><td style="text-align:right">23g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>甘松</td><td style="text-align:right">20g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>孜然</td><td style="text-align:right">20g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>毕拔</td><td style="text-align:right">15g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>灵草</td><td style="text-align:right">15g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>黄栀子</td><td style="text-align:right">10g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>香菜籽</td><td style="text-align:right">10g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>母丁香</td><td style="text-align:right">5g</td></tr>
  </table>
  <div style="font-size:11px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-top:6px">辣椒王+花椒散放汤中，其余香料用纱布袋包好。</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 📋 卤汤调制</div>
  <table class="ing-table">
    <tr><th>原料</th><th style="text-align:right">用量</th></tr>
    <tr><td>高汤</td><td style="text-align:right">50斤（25kg）</td></tr>
    <tr><td>混合油（鸡油+猪油+色拉油1:1:1）</td><td style="text-align:right">5斤（2.5kg）</td></tr>
    <tr><td>精盐</td><td style="text-align:right">750g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>糖色</td><td style="text-align:right">1,000-1,500g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>味精</td><td style="text-align:right">50g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>鸡精</td><td style="text-align:right">30g</td></tr>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 📋 卤制标准（每500g食材）</div>
  <table class="ing-table">
    <tr><th>调料</th><th style="text-align:right">用量</th></tr>
    <tr><td>精盐</td><td style="text-align:right">6-8g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>味精</td><td style="text-align:right">5g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>鸡精</td><td style="text-align:right">3g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>糖色</td><td style="text-align:right">10g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>料酒</td><td style="text-align:right">5g</td></tr>
  </table>
  <div style="font-size:11px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-top:6px">投料后烧开转小火，煮至食材熟透即可。</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 💰 成本参考</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>一锅卤水总成本</span><span class="v">约¥350-500</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>可卤食材</span><span class="v">100-150斤</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>每斤卤货成本（含料）</span><span class="v">约¥3-5</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>卤货售价</span><span class="v">¥25-45/斤</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 🔧 做法</div>
  <div class="launch" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.8">
    <span><strong>调卤汤：</strong></span>
    <span>① 高汤50斤入锅，加混合油、老姜、大葱、香菜烧香</span>
    <span>② 加精盐、味精、鸡精、糖色搅匀</span>
    <span>③ 香料包装袋入锅，辣椒王+花椒散放汤中</span>
    <span>④ 小火煮1h，关火静置1天使味道融合</span>
    <br>
    <span><strong>卤制：</strong></span>
    <span>⑤ 每500g食材加盐6-8g、味精5g、鸡精3g、糖色10g、料酒5g</span>
    <span>⑥ 烧开转小火，煮至食材熟透</span>
    <span>⑦ 关火浸泡入味（肉类多泡30-60min更好）</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 🚫 避坑</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 卤汤熬好后必须静置1天——刚熬好的卤汤各种香料味还没融合，单喝有药味。静置一天后味道圆润了再用。</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 辣椒王和花椒散放不装袋——装在袋里辣麻味出不来，散放在汤里才能充分释放。换新料时直接捞出旧料撒新料。</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 糖色分两次加——调汤时加一部分，卤制时每斤食材再加10g。一次加够颜色发黑。</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 老卤要养——每卤一次食材，卤汤里的盐和香料都会被带走。下次用前尝咸淡、补盐、补香料。</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 卤汤不用时每天烧开一次——不烧容易发酸。烧开晾凉放冰箱，可以放一周。长期不用就冷冻。</div>
</div>


</div>
</body>
</html>
